    "turn_text": "So I'm curious a little bit. I know you guys have a lot of events going on this year, but let's just talk a little bit about the industry as a whole. You guys have had it. This has been a really crazy year, I'm sure, for everybody. But what have you guys seen as far as NRCA and what kind of adjustments have had to be made?",
